# Minimal diffs only

- Change **only** what the user explicitly asked for.
- Do **not** expand scope: no related cleanups, extra files, env updates, refactors, or “while we’re here” fixes unless asked.
- Do **not** touch other sessions, packages, or configs unless they are named in the request.
- Prefer the smallest edit that satisfies the request. Verify only what you changed.

## Examples

```text
❌ Asked: convert tool params to Zod in step1-basic-agent.js
   Also updated session-4/5 .env and model.ts

✅ Asked: convert tool params to Zod in step1-basic-agent.js
   Only edited step1-basic-agent.js
```

```text
❌ Asked: fix decommissioned Groq model in session-6
   Also rewrote env loading and added Ollama support

✅ Asked: fix decommissioned Groq model in session-6
   Replaced the model ID in the session-6 files that use it
```

If a related fix seems necessary, ask first — do not apply it unprompted.
